abstract: >-
  An R-based reproducible workflow for harmonising quarterly takaful data from the
  Islamic Financial Services Board (IFSB) Prudential and Structural Islamic Financial
  Indicators (PSIFIs). The release provides an analysis-ready panel for seven
  jurisdictions over 2019Q1-2023Q4 (120 jurisdiction-quarters), together with scripts,
  documentation, verification checks, reporting-mode diagnostics, and
  publication-quality figures. Code is released under the MIT Licence; the derived
  panel and documentation are released under CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA.md).
